helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0206.xhp	0	help	par_id3154277	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUM_TOOLBOX\"\>The \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> bar contains functions to modify the structure of numbered paragraphs, including changing the order of paragraphs and defining different paragraph levels.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Status Bar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153397	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0208.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414	2			0	lt	The Status Bar contains information about the current document and offers various buttons with special functions. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id9648731				0	lt	Language				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the language for the selected text. \<br/\>Click to open a menu where you can choose another language for the selected text or for the current paragraph. \<br/\>Choose None to exclude the text from spellchecking and hyphenation. \<br/\>Choose Reset to Default Language to re-apply the default language for the selection or the paragraph. \<br/\>Choose More to open a dialog with more options.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id0821200911015962				0	lt	Digital Signature				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id0821200911015941				0	lt	See also \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/digital_signatures.xhp\"\>Digital Signatures\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	hd_id8070314				0	lt	Zoom & View Layout				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id7723929				0	lt	Three controls on the Writer Status Bar allow to change the zoom and view layout of your text documents. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id3666188				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The View Layout icons show from left to right: Single column mode. View mode with pages side by side. Book mode with two pages as in an open book.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0208.xhp	0	help	par_id8796349				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Drag the Zoom slider to the left to show more pages, drag to the right to zoom into a page and show a smaller area of the page.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Page Preview				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145783	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0210.xhp\" name=\"Page Preview\"\>Page Preview\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154253	2			0	lt	The \<emph\>Page Preview\</emph\> Bar appears when you view the current document in the page preview mode.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Rulers				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154201	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/swriter/main0213.xhp\" name=\"Rulers\"\>Rulers\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	2			0	lt	Rulers display the dimensions of the page, and the position of tabs, indents, borders and columns. You can modify all of these on the rulers using the mouse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0213.xhp	0	help	par_id3154239	3			0	lt	By double-clicking on the ruler, you can open the \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\> dialog and assign \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#formatierung\" name=\"direct paragraph formatting\"\>direct paragraph formatting\</link\> for the current paragraph or all selected paragraphs.				20130618 17:22:18
