helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\main0214.xhp	0	help	par_id3154254	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The \<emph\>Formula\</emph\> Bar allows you to create and insert calculations into a text document.\</ahelp\> To activate the \<emph\>Formula\</emph\> Bar, press F2.				20130618 17:22:18
