helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433835				0	lt	The Formatting Bar is shown when a chart is set to edit mode. Double-click a chart to enter edit mode. Click outside the chart to leave edit mode.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200911433878				0	lt	You can edit the formatting of a chart using the controls and icons on the Formatting Bar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	hd_id0810200902300436				0	lt	Select Chart Element				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200902300479				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the element from the chart that you want to format. The element gets selected in the chart preview. Click Format Selection to open the properties dialog for the selected element.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
