helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id0810200902300630				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Horizontal Grid On/Off icon on the Formatting bar toggles the visibility of the grid display for the Y axis.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
