helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0202.xhp	0	help	par_id081020090230076				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To show or hide a legend, click Legend On/Off on the Formatting bar.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
