helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E1				0	lt	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				20130618 17:22:18
