helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FE				0	lt	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20130618 17:22:18
