helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790	2			0	lt	The commands in this menu are used to edit formulas. In addition to basic commands, (for example, copying contents) there are functions specific to $[officename] Math such as searching for placeholders or errors.				20130618 17:22:18
