helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959	2			0	lt	Use this menu to open and edit the symbol catalog, or import an external formula as a data file. The program interface can be adjusted to meet your requirements. You can also change the program options.				20130618 17:22:18
