helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338	2			0	lt	The default toolbars available when working with an activated formula document in $[officename] Math are described here. You can customize the toolbars to meet your requirements by moving, deleting or adding new icons.				20130618 17:22:18
