helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0206.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Status Bar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0206.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Status Bar\"\>Status Bar\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0206.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020	2			0	lt	The status bar displays information about your document, including the currently selected object. You can double-click some status bar items to open a related dialog window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Rulers				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153191				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>rulers; in presentations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>origin of rulers\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153191	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Rulers\"\>Rulers\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666	2			0	lt	You can use vertical and horizontal rulers at the left and upper edges of the $[officename] Impress workspace to assist you in creating your slide. The sections of the rulers that cover the area of the slide are white.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963	4			0	lt	When you select an object, its dimensions are displayed on the rulers as gray double lines. To precisely resize the object, drag one of the double lines to a new location on the ruler.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3150206	8			0	lt	When you select a text object on a slide, indents and tabs are displayed on the horizontal ruler. To change the indent or tab settings for the text object, drag an indent or a tab marker to a new location on the ruler.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3150253	7			0	lt	You can also drag a \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/04030000.xhp\" name=\"snap line\"\>snap line\</link\> from a ruler to help you align objects on your slide. To insert a snap line using a ruler, drag the edge of a ruler into the slide.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3153820	3			0	lt	To show or hide the rulers, choose \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/03060000.xhp\" name=\"View - Rulers\"\>\<emph\>View - Rulers\</emph\>\</link\>. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3148609	9			0	lt	To specify the measurement units for a ruler, right-click the ruler, and then choose a new unit from the list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129	6			0	lt	To change the origin (0 point) of the rulers, drag the intersection of the two rulers in the top left corner into the workspace. Vertical and horizontal guides appear. Continue to drag until the vertical and horizontal guides are where you want the new origin to be, and then release. To reset the origins of the rulers to the default values, double-click the intersection.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0209.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651	5			0	lt	To change the slide margins, drag the edge of the white areas in the rulers.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Drawing Bar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150342	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/main0210.xhp\" name=\"Drawing Bar\"\>Drawing Bar\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3150202	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar contains frequently used editing tools. Click the arrow next to an icon to open a toolbar that contains additional commands.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id31502029				0	lt	You can view the Drawing bar also from a text document or spreadsheet. The set of visible icons can be slightly different according to the current document type.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155962	3			0	lt	Select				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	4			0	lt	To select an object on the current slide, click the \<emph\>Select\</emph\> tool (white arrow) on the Drawing bar, and then click the object.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148610	5			0	lt	To select more than one object, hold down Shift while you click.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699	6			0	lt	To select an object that is behind another object, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click the object. To select the next underlying object in the stacking, hold \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click again. To return the selection to the previously selected object, hold down Shift + \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then click.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3154651	7			0	lt	To add text to a selected object, double-click the object and type or enter your text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_id3153812	12			0	lt	To remove a selection, click anywhere outside the selected object, or press Escape.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B0				0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10060000.xhp\"\>Rectangle\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C0				0	lt	Draws a filled rectangle where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to place a corner of the rectangle, and drag to the size you want. To draw a square, hold down Shift while you drag.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10070000.xhp\"\>Ellipse\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	lt	Draws a filled oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	lt	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10050000.xhp\"\>Text\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\main0210.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	lt	Draws a text box where you click or drag in the current document. Click anywhere in the document, and then type or paste your text.				20130618 17:22:18
