helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	$[officename] Calc Features				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154758	1			0	lt	\<variable id=\"main0503\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/main0503.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Calc Features\"\>$[officename] Calc Features\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457	2			0	lt	$[officename] Calc is a spreadsheet application that you can use to calculate, analyze, and manage your data. You can also import and modify Microsoft Excel spreadsheets.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148797	4			0	lt	Calculations				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145172	5			0	lt	$[officename] Calc provides you with \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060100.xhp\" name=\"functions\"\>functions\</link\>, including statistical and banking functions, that you can use to create formulas to perform complex calculations on your data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	6			0	lt	You can also use the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060000.xhp\" name=\"AutoPilots\"\>Function Wizard\</link\> to help you create your formulas.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596	13			0	lt	What-If Calculations				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444	14			0	lt	An interesting feature is to be able to immediately view the results of changes made to one factor of calculations that are composed of several factors. For instance, you can see how changing the time period in a loan calculation affects the interest rates or repayment amounts. Furthermore, you can manage larger tables by using different predefined scenarios.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576	7			0	lt	Database Functions				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011	8			0	lt	Use spreadsheets to arrange, store, and filter your data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942	25			0	lt	$[officename] Calc lets you drag-and-drop tables from databases, or lets you use a spreadsheet as a data source for creating form letters in $[officename] Writer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145800	9			0	lt	Arranging Data				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	10			0	lt	With a few mouse-clicks, you can reorganize your spreadsheet to show or hide certain data ranges, or to format ranges according to special conditions, or to quickly calculate subtotals and totals.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155601	16			0	lt	Dynamic Charts				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121	17			0	lt	$[officename] Calc lets you present spreadsheet data in dynamic charts that update automatically when the data changes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153707	18			0	lt	Opening and Saving Microsoft Files				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\main0503.xhp	0	help	par_id3157867	19			0	lt	Use the $[officename] filters to convert Excel files, or to open and save in a variety of other \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000020.xhp\" name=\"formats\"\>formats\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
