helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146957	17			0	lt	\<variable id=\"border_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/border_object.xhp\" name=\"Defining Borders for Objects\"\>Defining Borders for Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797	1			0	lt	In Writer, you can define borders around OLE objects, plug-ins, diagrams/charts, graphics and frames. The name of the menu to be used depends on the object selected.				20130618 17:22:18
