helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	4			0	lt	Click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>OLE-Object\</emph\> toolbar or \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> toolbar to open the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159176	6			0	lt	Click one of the predefined border styles. This replaces the current border style of the object with the selected style.				20130618 17:22:18
