helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3154250	6			0	lt	You can perform a calculation on cells in one table and display the result in a different table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508	26			0	lt	Open a text document, insert a table with multiple columns and rows, and then insert another table consisting of one cell.				20130618 17:22:18
