helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3154246	4			0	lt	Fields are used for data that changes in a document, such as the current date or the total number of pages in a document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154262	5			0	lt	Viewing Fields				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509	6			0	lt	Fields consist of a field name and the field content. To switch the field display between the field name or the field content, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"View - Fields\"\>\<emph\>View - Field Names\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536	195			0	lt	To display or hide field highlighting in a document, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\>. To permanently disable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Appearance\</emph\>, and clear the check box in front of \<emph\>Field shadings\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885	7			0	lt	To change the color of field shadings, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Appearance\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>$[officename] - Appearance\</item\>\</link\>\</emph\>, locate the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field shadings\</item\> option, and then select a different color in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color setting\</item\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153166	8			0	lt	Field Properties				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3153180	181			0	lt	Most field types in a document, including database fields, store and display variable values.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533	182			0	lt	The following field types execute an action when you click the field:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155582	183			0	lt	Field Type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147760	184			0	lt	Property				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147789	185			0	lt	Placeholder				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147812	186			0	lt	Opens a dialog to insert the object for which the placeholder was set.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147216	187			0	lt	Insert Reference				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147239	188			0	lt	Moves the mouse pointer to the reference.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147267	189			0	lt	Run macro				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147290	190			0	lt	Runs a macro.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145614	191			0	lt	Input Field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145637	192			0	lt	Opens a dialog to edit the contents of the field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244	10			0	lt	Placeholder, hidden text, insert reference, variable, database, and user-defined fields display a help tip when you rest the mouse pointer over the field in a document. To enable this feature, ensure that the Extended Tips\<emph/\>option (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>What's This?\</item\>) is selected in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help\</item\> menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155937	11			0	lt	Updating Fields				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155963	12			0	lt	To update all of the fields in a document, press F9, or choose \<emph\>Edit - Select All\</emph\>, and then press F9.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155984	13			0	lt	To update a field that was inserted from a database, select the field, and then press F9.				20130618 17:22:18
