helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id5659962				0	lt	If you have a text that was hidden by defining a condition with a variable, you have several options to display the hidden text. Do one of the following:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3152777	7			0	lt	Enable the check mark at \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3153902	44			0	lt	Double-click in front of the variable that you used to define the condition for hiding the text, and enter a different value for the variable.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id3147114	45			0	lt	Double-click in front of the hidden text field or the hidden paragraph field, and change the condition statement.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text_display.xhp	0	help	par_id1865901				0	lt	\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Hiding Text\"\>Hiding Text\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
