helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149291	6			0	lt	\<variable id=\"references_modify\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/references_modify.xhp\" name=\"Modifying Cross-References\"\>Modifying Cross-References\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3153132	2			0	lt	Click in front of the cross-reference that you want to modify.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632	3			0	lt	If you cannot see the field shading of the cross-reference, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\> or press \<emph\>Ctrl+F8\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
