helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3145101	7			0	lt	Set the options that you want, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references_modify.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255	5			0	lt	Use the arrow buttons in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Fields\</item\>         \<emph/\>dialog to browse through the cross-references in the current document.				20130618 17:22:18
