helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149963	26			0	lt	\<variable id=\"reset_format\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/reset_format.xhp\" name=\"Resetting Font Attributes\"\>Resetting Font Attributes\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3154091	27			0	lt	You can quickly exit manual formatting by pressing the right-arrow key. For example, if you have pressed Ctrl+B to apply the bold typeface to the text that you type, press the right arrow to return to the default character format of the paragraph.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854	28			0	lt	To reset all direct formatting of existing text, select that text, then choose the menu command \<emph\>Format - Default Formatting\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
