helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918	2			0	lt	You can delete a table from your document, or delete the contents of the table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3155863	5			0	lt	To delete a whole table, click in the table, and then choose \<emph\>Table - Delete - Table\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_delete.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415	6			0	lt	To delete the contents of a table, click in the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A until all cells are selected, and then press Delete or Backspace.				20130618 17:22:18
