helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155870				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>tables; heading repetition after page breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>repeating; table headings after page breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>headings; repeating in tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>multi-page tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
