helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644	33			0	lt	If you want to automatically hyphenate more than one paragraph, use a paragraph style.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956	48			0	lt	For example, enable the automatic hyphenation option for the "Default" paragraph style, and then apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				20130618 17:22:18
