helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	57			0	lt	In the \<emph\>Hyphenation\</emph\> area, select the \<emph\>Automatically\</emph\> check box.				20130618 17:22:18
