helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	lt	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a format.				20130618 17:22:18
