helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	8			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NAVI_TBX7\"\>Shows or hides the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
