helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10795				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the cursor to the next object of the selected type.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
