helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156094	15			0	lt	Inserts the selected AutoText into the current document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148788	75			0	lt	If you insert an unformatted AutoText entry into a paragraph, the entry is formatted with the current paragraph style.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150039	17			0	lt	AutoText				20130618 17:22:18
