helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147506	1			0	lt	Insert Bookmark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149806	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"textmarkeein\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertBookmark\"\>Inserts a bookmark at the cursor position. You can then use the Navigator to quickly jump to the marked location at a later time.\</ahelp\> In an HTML document, bookmarks are converted to anchors that you can jump to from a hyperlink. \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677	3			0	lt	To jump to a specific bookmark, press F5 to open the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\>, click the plus sign (+) next to the\<emph\> Bookmark\</emph\> entry, and then double-click the bookmark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151308	4			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>You can also right-click the \<emph\>Page Number\</emph\> field at the left end of the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\> at the bottom of the document window, and then choose the bookmark that you want to jump to.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154188	5			0	lt	Bookmarks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178	10			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:COMBOBOX:DLG_INSERT_BOOKMARK:CB_BOOKMARK\"\>Type the name of the bookmark that you want to create. The lower list contains all of the bookmarks in the current document. To delete a bookmark, select it in the list, and then click \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483	13			0	lt	You cannot use the following characters in a bookmark name: / \\ @ : * ? " ; , . #				20130618 17:22:18
