helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960	3			0	lt	Consult the documentation that came with your printer for setting up the printer for envelopes. Depending on the printer model, envelopes may have to be placed left, right, in the middle, and either face up or face down.				20130618 17:22:18
