helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148569	2			0	lt	Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for the section.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390	4			0	lt	Sections follow the text flow behavior of the page they are inserted into.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3083448	5			0	lt	For example, if you insert a section that uses a two-column layout into a page style that uses a four-column layout, the two-column layout is nested inside one of the four columns.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625	6			0	lt	You can also nest sections, that is, you can insert a section into another section.				20130618 17:22:18
