helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145822	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Protect\"\>Prevents the contents of the selected cells from being modified.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154641	3			0	lt	When the cursor is in a read-only cell, a note appears on the \<emph\>Status Bar\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05100300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292	4			0	lt	To remove cell protection, select the cell(s), right-click, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05100400.xhp\" name=\"Cell - Unprotect\"\>\<emph\>Cell - Unprotect\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
