helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155897	13			0	lt	Use Page Styles to organize the structure of the document, and to add page numbers. You can also specify the page style to apply to the first page that follows after a page break.				20130618 17:22:18
