helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\10110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148775	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PreviewPrintOptions\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Opens a dialog where settings for the printout of your document can be made.\</ahelp\> The pages are proportionally reduced in size. When printing multiple document pages on one printed page, the whole sheet of paper may not be printed on and a margin may remain.				20130618 17:22:18
