helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149666	1			0	lt	Format Selection				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"objekteigenschaften\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Formats the selected object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Depending on the object selected, the command opens dialogs that you can also open by choosing the following commands from the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> menu:				20130618 17:22:18
