helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Data Point				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05010100.xhp\" name=\"Data Point\"\>Data Point\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577	2			0	lt	This dialog allows you to change the properties of a selected data point. The dialog appears when there is only one data point selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121	3			0	lt	Any changes made only affect this one data point. For example, if you edit the color of a bar, only the color of that bar will be different.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Data Series				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150449	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05010200.xhp\" name=\"Data Series\"\>Data Series\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750	2			0	lt	Use this to change the properties of a selected data series. This dialog appears when one data series is selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154015	4			0	lt	Any changes made here affect the entire data series. For example, if you change the color, all elements belonging to this data series will change color.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146916	3			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/04050000.xhp\" name=\"Y Error Bars\"\>Y Error Bars\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
