helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750	2			0	lt	Allows you to modify the order of the data series already set in the chart.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	8			0	lt	The position of the data in the data table remains unchanged. You can only choose the commands after inserting a chart in $[officename] Calc.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757	5			0	lt	This function is only available if you have data displayed in columns. It is not possible to switch to data display in rows.				20130618 17:22:18
