helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020	6			0	lt	You can see a preview of the selected font with its attributes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154656	7			0	lt	Attributes				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150208	8			0	lt	You can assign additional attributes to the selected font.				20130618 17:22:18
