helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3157972	79			0	lt	The overlapping area of the selected objects creates the new shape.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\combine_etc.xhp	0	help	par_id3151020	80			0	lt	The area outside the overlap is removed.				20130618 17:22:18
