helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715	17			0	lt	\<variable id=\"cross_fading\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/cross_fading.xhp\" name=\"Cross-Fading Two Objects\"\>Cross-Fading Two Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754	18			0	lt	Cross-fading creates shapes and distributes them by uniform increments between two drawing objects.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3155112	41			0	lt	The cross-fading command is only available in $[officename] Draw. You can, however, copy and paste cross-faded objects into $[officename] Impress.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149209	20			0	lt	To cross-fade two objects:				20130618 17:22:18
