helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428	22			0	lt	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Cross-fading\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450	44			0	lt	Enter a value to specify the number of objects between the start and end of the cross-fade in the \<emph\>Increments\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
