helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600	2			0	lt	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Picture - From File\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749	3			0	lt	Locate the picture you want to insert. Select the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box to insert only a link to the picture. If you want to see the picture before you insert it, select \<emph\>Preview\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\graphic_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764	4			0	lt	After you insert a linked picture, do not change the name of the source picture or move the source picture to another directory.				20130618 17:22:18
