helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150752	2			0	lt	To connect lines:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714	4			0	lt	Select two or more lines.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3156383	5			0	lt	Right-click and choose \<emph\>Modify - Connect\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	11			0	lt	To create a closed object, right-click a line and choose \<emph\>Close Object\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\join_objects.xhp	0	help	par_id3150363	9			0	lt	You can only use the \<emph\>Close Object\</emph\> command on connected lines, \<emph\>Freeform Lines \</emph\>and unfilled \<emph\>Curves\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
