helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155266	49			0	lt	Click the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156450\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_text.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156450\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> and move the mouse pointer to where you want to enter the text box.				20130618 17:22:18
