helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A3				0	lt	With the text object selected, choose \<emph\>Format - Text\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Text\</emph\> dialog opens.				20130618 17:22:18
