helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120	2			0	lt	This section describes how to assign Basic programs to program events.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263	4			0	lt	You can automatically execute a macro when a specified software event occurs by assigning the desired macro to the event. The following table provides an overview of program events and at what point an assigned macro is executed.				20130618 17:22:18
