helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799	6			0	lt	An assigned macro is executed...				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379	7			0	lt	Program Start				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715	8			0	lt	... after a $[officename] application is started.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146914	9			0	lt	Program End				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153765	10			0	lt	...before a $[officename] application is terminated.				20130618 17:22:18
