helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808	12			0	lt	...after a new document is created with \<emph\>File - New\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>New\</emph\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790	13			0	lt	Open Document				20130618 17:22:18
