helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153379	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010102.xhp\" name=\"MsgBox Function [Runtime]\"\>MsgBox Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171	2			0	lt	Displays a dialog box containing a message and returns a value.				20130618 17:22:18
