helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010302.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148947	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03010302.xhp\" name=\"Green Function [Runtime]\"\>Green Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
