helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	8			0	lt	\<emph\>Position:\</emph\> For files opened in Random mode, \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is the number of the record that you want to read.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768	9			0	lt	For files opened in Binary mode, \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is the byte position in the file where the reading starts.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147319	10			0	lt	If \<emph\>Position\</emph\> is omitted, the current position or the current data record of the file is used.				20130618 17:22:18
