helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020205.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685	2			0	lt	Writes data to a sequential file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020205.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150449	3			0	lt	Syntax:				20130618 17:22:18
