helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020414.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909	6			0	lt	FileName: Name of the file, including the path, that you want to test attributes of. If you do not enter a path, \<emph\>SetAttr\</emph\> searches for the file in the current directory. You can also use \<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/00000002.xhp\" name=\"URL notation\"\>URL notation\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
