helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149180	2			0	lt	The following are the trigonometric functions that are supported in $[officename] Basic.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Atn Function [Runtime]				20130618 17:22:18
