helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381	6			0	lt	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any expression that you want to evaluate. If the expression evaluates to \<emph\>True\</emph\>, the function returns the result of ExpressionTrue, otherwise it returns the result of ExpressionFalse.				20130618 17:22:18
