helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414	8			0	lt	\<emph\>Expression:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to convert. If the \<emph\>Expression\</emph\> exceeds the value range between -32768 and 32767, $[officename] Basic reports an overflow error. To convert a string expression, the number must be entered as normal text ("123.5") using the default number format of your operating system.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358	9			0	lt	This function always rounds the fractional part of a number to the nearest integer.				20130618 17:22:18
