helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id711996				0	lt	Optionally, you can add the \<emph\>Preserve\</emph\> keyword as a parameter to preserve the contents of the array that is redimensioned.				20130618 17:22:18
