helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120102.xhp	0	help	par_id3159414	9			0	lt	Use the \<emph\>Chr$\</emph\> function to send special control sequences to a printer or to another output source. You can also use it to insert quotation marks in a string expression.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154366	10			0	lt	Example:				20130618 17:22:18
