helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864	11			0	lt	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid function\</emph\> is omitted, all characters in the string expression from the start position to the end of the string are returned.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762	12			0	lt	If the Length parameter in the \<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\> is less than the length of the text that you want to replace, the text is reduced to the specified length.				20130618 17:22:18
