helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\main0601.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226	10			0	lt	This help section explains the most common runtime functions of %PRODUCTNAME Basic. For more in-depth information please refer to the \<link href=\"http://wiki.services.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/BASIC_Guide\"\>OpenOffice.org BASIC Programming Guide\</link\> on the OpenOffice.org Wiki.				20130618 17:22:18
