helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064	79			0	lt	Select \<emph\>GIF - Graphics Interchange Format (.gif)\</emph\> in the \<emph\>File type \</emph\>list.				20130618 17:22:18
