helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3150655	70			0	lt	On the \<emph\>Tasks\</emph\> pane, click \<emph\>Slide Transition\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
