helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_slidechange.xhp	0	help	par_id3148826	49			0	lt	If you want, you can use the \<emph\>Zoom\</emph\> toolbar \<image id=\"img_id3151172\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_zoom.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151172\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to change the view magnification for the slides.				20130618 17:22:18
