helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\html_import.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228	8			0	lt	Select all of the text that lies below the visible slide area and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+X.				20130618 17:22:18
