helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\vectorize.xhp	0	help	par_id3155633	27			0	lt	A vector graphic can be resized without losing the quality of the graphic. In $[officename] Draw and Impress, you can convert a bitmap image into a vector graphic.				20130618 17:22:18
