helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"dateitext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImportFromFile\"\>Inserts a file into the active slide. You can insert $[officename] Draw or Impress files, or text from an HTML document or a text file.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> If you have an active internet connection, you can also insert text from a web page by entering its URL in the \<emph\>File name \</emph\>box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155446	4			0	lt	You can also choose to only insert specific \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/04110100.xhp\" name=\"slides or objects\"\>slides or objects\</link\> from $[officename] Draw or Impress files.				20130618 17:22:18
