helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ExpandPage\"\>Creates a new slide from every top-level outline point (text one level below the title text in the outline hierarchy) in the selected slide. The outline text becomes the title of the new slide.\</ahelp\> Outline points below the top level on the original slide are moved up one level on the new slide.				20130618 17:22:18
