helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377	4			0	lt	For more information, see the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp\" name=\"Glossary\"\>Glossary\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155333	3			0	lt	You can also copy the selected object and choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special \</emph\>and select the bitmap format from the list\<emph/\>.				20130618 17:22:18
