helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\13050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConvertIntoMetaFile\"\>Converts the selected object to Windows Metafile Format (WMF), containing both bitmap and vector graphic data.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
