helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149292	94			0	lt	Freeform Line, Filled				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147256	98			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Freeline\"\>Draws a freeform line where you drag in the slide. When you release, $[officename] creates a closed shape by drawing a straight line segment from the endpoint to the starting point of the line. The shape within the lines will be filled with the current area color.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
