helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153038	4			0	lt	To rotate a 3D object around any of its three axes, click to select the object, and then click again to display its rotation handles. Drag a handle in the direction you want to rotate the object.				20130618 17:22:18
