helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132	11			0	lt	\<variable id=\"autoformat\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/autoformat.xhp\" name=\"Using AutoFormat for Tables\"\>Applying Automatic Formatting to a Selected Cell Range\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401	12			0	lt	You can use the AutoFormat feature to quickly apply a format to a sheet or a selected cell range.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	lt	To Apply an AutoFormat to a Sheet or Selected Cell Range				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CE				0	lt	Select the cells, including the column and row headers, that you want to format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	lt	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242	27			0	lt	To select which properties to include in an AutoFormat, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	lt	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075D				0	lt	The format is applied to the selected range of cells.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210	14			0	lt	If you do not see any change in color of the cell contents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Value Highlighting\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3155379	22			0	lt	To Define an AutoFormat for Spreadsheets				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3148868	26			0	lt	You can define a new AutoFormat that is available to all spreadsheets.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3152985	23			0	lt	Format a sheet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384	24			0	lt	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Select All\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815	25			0	lt	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A9				0	lt	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10760				0	lt	In the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box of the \<emph\>Add AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog, enter a name for the format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C3				0	lt	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3159203	28			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05110000.xhp\" name=\"Format - AutoFormat\"\>Format - AutoFormat\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
