helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	lt	To remove the highlighting, unmark the menu entry.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	lt	Text cells are formatted in black, formulas in green, and number cells in blue, no matter how their display is formatted.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	lt	If this function is active, colors that you define in the document will not be displayed. When you deactivate the function, the user-defined colors are displayed again.				20130618 17:22:18
