helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"zelleneinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertCell\"\>Opens the\<emph\> Insert Cells \</emph\>dialog, in which you can insert new cells according to the options that you specify.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can delete cells by choosing \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Delete Cells\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Delete Cells\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
