helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262	4			0	lt	This area contains the options available for inserting cells into a sheet. The cell quantity and position is defined by selecting a cell range in the sheet beforehand.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146120	5			0	lt	Shift cells down				20130618 17:22:18
