helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153877	9			0	lt	Entire row				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417	10			0	lt	\<variable id=\"zeilenganzetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_INSROWS\"\>Inserts an entire row. The position of the row is determined by the selection on the sheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The number of rows inserted depends on how many rows are selected. The contents of the original rows are moved downward.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146971	11			0	lt	Entire column				20130618 17:22:18
