helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10609				0	lt	In the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04050000.xhp\"\>Insert Sheet\</link\> dialog, select the sheet that you want to insert.				20130618 17:22:18
