helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122	48			0	lt	On this page, you can view the structure of the function.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149350	4			0	lt	If you start the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\> while the cell cursor is positioned in a cell that already contains a function, the \<emph\>Structure\</emph\> tab is opened and shows the composition of the current formula.				20130618 17:22:18
