helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149431	173			0	lt	ADDRESS				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3156054	174			0	lt	Returns the absolute address of the referenced cell.				20130618 17:22:18
