helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200904123919				0	lt	=UNICODE("©") returns the Unicode number 169 for the Copyright character.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145178				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>UPPER function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
