helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146114	24			0	lt	YEARS(StartDate; EndDate; Type)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3145387	25			0	lt	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> is the first date				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3156290	26			0	lt	\<emph\>EndDate\</emph\> is the second date				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3152893	27			0	lt	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> calculates the type of difference. Possible values are 0 (interval) and 1 (in calendar years).				20130618 17:22:18
