helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3153066	29			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_DIFFMONTHS\"\>Calculates the difference in months between two dates.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
