helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3146869	31			0	lt	MONTHS(StartDate; EndDate; Type)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3145075	32			0	lt	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> is the first date				20130618 17:22:18
