helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337	75			0	lt	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149051	76			0	lt	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147297	77			0	lt	\<emph\>Issue\</emph\> is the date of issue of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150393	78			0	lt	\<emph\>FirstCoupon\</emph\> is the first interest date of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147402	79			0	lt	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual rate of interest.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387	80			0	lt	\<emph\>Yield\</emph\> is the annual yield of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153023	81			0	lt	\<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150539	82			0	lt	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157871				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>ODDFYIELD function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
