helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147414	88			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ODDFYIELD\"\>Calculates the yield of a security if the first interest date falls irregularly.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150651	89			0	lt	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3152982	90			0	lt	ODDFYIELD(Settlement; Maturity; Issue; FirstCoupon; Rate; Price; Redemption; Frequency; Basis)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3157906	91			0	lt	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150026	92			0	lt	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20130618 17:22:18
