helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150465	95			0	lt	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual rate of interest.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146940	96			0	lt	\<emph\>Price\</emph\> is the price of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149893	97			0	lt	\<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148888	98			0	lt	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153933				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>ODDLPRICE function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153933	103			0	lt	ODDLPRICE				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145145	104			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ODDLPRICE\"\>Calculates the price per 100 currency units par value of a security, if the last interest date falls irregularly.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152784	105			0	lt	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155262	106			0	lt	ODDLPRICE(Settlement; Maturity; LastInterest; Rate; Yield; Redemption; Frequency; Basis)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149689	107			0	lt	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148753	108			0	lt	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150861	109			0	lt	\<emph\>LastInterest\</emph\> is the last interest date of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155831	110			0	lt	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual rate of interest.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153328	111			0	lt	\<emph\>Yield\</emph\> is the annual yield of the security.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149186	112			0	lt	\<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149726	113			0	lt	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153111	114			0	lt	Example				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999	115			0	lt	Settlement date: February 7 1999, maturity date: June 15 1999, last interest: October 15 1998. Interest rate: 3.75 per cent, yield: 4.05 per cent, redemption value: 100 currency units, frequency of payments: half-yearly = 2, basis: = 0				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148567	116			0	lt	The price per 100 currency units per value of a security, which has an irregular last interest date, is calculated as follows:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150332	117			0	lt	=ODDLPRICE("1999-02-07";"1999-06-15";"1998-10-15"; 0.0375; 0.0405;100;2;0) returns 99.87829.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153564				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>ODDLYIELD function\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153564	118			0	lt	ODDLYIELD				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3158002	119			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_ODDLYIELD\"\>Calculates the yield of a security if the last interest date falls irregularly.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
