helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3153903	113			0	lt	            \<emph\>Mode\</emph\> = 1 calculates the one-tailed test, \<emph\>Mode\</emph\> = 2 the two- tailed test.				20130618 17:22:18
