helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552	4			0	lt	The merged cell receives the name of the first cell of the original cell range. Merged cells cannot be merged a second time with other cells. The range must form a rectangle, multiple selection is not supported.				20130618 17:22:18
