helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149499	18			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLDLG_NEWBYEXAMPLE\"\>Creates a new style based on the formatting of a selected object.\</ahelp\> Assign a name for the style in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05140100.xhp\" name=\"Create Style\"\>Create Style\</link\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
