helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146115	19			0	lt	Alignment				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156445	20			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_AUTOFORMAT:BTN_ALIGNMENT\"\>When marked, specifies that you want to retain the alignment of the selected format.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155811	21			0	lt	AutoFit width and height				20130618 17:22:18
