helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153912	28			0	lt	The \<emph\>Rename AutoFormat\</emph\> dialog opens.\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_REN_AFMT_NAME\"\> Enter the new name of the AutoFormat here.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
