helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149413	4			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONDFORMAT:CBX_COND3\"\>Mark the boxes corresponding to each condition and enter the corresponding condition.\</ahelp\> To close the dialog, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147394	5			0	lt	Cell Value / Formula				20130618 17:22:18
