helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"silben\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Hyphenate\"\>The \<emph\>Hyphenation \</emph\>command calls the dialog for setting the hyphenation in $[officename] Calc.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
