helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156285	10			0	lt	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394	11			0	lt	Each time you call the command you turn the hyphenation for the drawing object on or off. A check mark shows the current status.				20130618 17:22:18
