helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211	2			0	lt	This command activates the Spreadsheet Detective. With the Detective, you can trace the dependencies from the current formula cell to the cells in the spreadsheet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447	3			0	lt	Once you have defined a trace, you can point with the mouse cursor to the trace. The mouse cursor will change its shape. Double-click the trace with this cursor to select the referenced cell at the end of the trace. 				20130618 17:22:18
