helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158212	22			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SortDescending\"\>\<variable id=\"sytext\"\>Sorts the selection from the highest to the lowest value, or from the lowest to the highest value. Number fields are sorted by size and text fields by the order of the characters. You can define the sort rules on Data - Sort - Options.\</variable\>\</ahelp\> You define the default on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language settings - Languages.				20130618 17:22:18
