helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F7				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090106.xhp\"\>Data Field Options\</link\> dialog. The \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button is visible for column, row, or page fields only.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10708				0	lt	If the dialog is expanded by the \<emph\>More\</emph\> button, the following items are added to the dialog:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070B				0	lt	Displayed value				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070F				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For each data field, you can select the type of display.\</ahelp\> For some types you can select additional information for a base field and a base item.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	lt	Type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371266\"\>Select the type of calculating of the displayed value for the data field.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10724				0	lt	Type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072A				0	lt	Displayed value				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	lt	Normal				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	lt	Results are shown unchanged				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	lt	Difference from				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10744				0	lt	From each result, its reference value (see below) is subtracted, and the difference is shown. Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	lt	\<emph\>Named item\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074C				0	lt	If a base item name is specified, the reference value for a combination of field items is the result where the item in the base field is replaced by the specified base item.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074F				0	lt	\<emph\>Previous item or Next item\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	lt	If "previous item" or "next item" is specified as the base item, the reference value is the result for the next visible member of the base field, in the base field's sort order.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	lt	% Of				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10761				0	lt	Each result is divided by its reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076A				0	lt	% Difference from				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	lt	From each result, its reference value is subtracted, and the difference is divided by the reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10777				0	lt	Running total in				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	lt	Each result is added to the sum of the results for preceding items in the base field, in the base field's sort order, and the total sum is shown.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	lt	Results are always summed, even if a different summary function was used to get each result.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10787				0	lt	% of row				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078D				0	lt	Each result is divided by the total result for its row in the pivot table. If there are several data fields, the total for the result's data field is used. If there are subtotals with manually selected summary functions, the total with the data field's summary function is still used. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	lt	% of column				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079A				0	lt	Same as "% of row", but the total for the result's column is used.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A1				0	lt	% of total				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A7				0	lt	Same as "% of row", but the grand total for the result's data field is used.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AE				0	lt	Index				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B4				0	lt	The row and column totals and the grand total, following the same rules as above, are used to calculate the following expression:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B7				0	lt	( original result * grand total ) / ( row total * column total )				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BA				0	lt	Base field				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BE				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371267\"\>Select the field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C1				0	lt	Base item				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C5				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371268\"\>Select the item of the base field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Data Field Options				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	bm_id711386				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>hiding;data fields, from calculations in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>display options in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sorting;options in pivot table\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>data field options for pivot table\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10542				0	lt	Data Field Options				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10546				0	lt	You can specify additional options for column, row, and page data fields in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\"\>pivot table\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10557				0	lt	Sort by				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055B				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495387653\"\>Select the data field that you want to sort columns or rows by.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055E				0	lt	Ascending				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10562				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384580\"\>Sorts the values from the lowest value to the highest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10565				0	lt	Descending				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10569				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384581\"\>Sorts the values descending from the highest value to the lowest value. If the selected field is the field for which the dialog was opened, the items are sorted by name. If a data field was selected, the items are sorted by the resultant value of the selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	lt	Manual				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10570				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495384582\"\>Sorts values alphabetically.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10585				0	lt	Display options				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10589				0	lt	You can specify the display options for all row fields except for the last, innermost row field.				20130618 17:22:18
