helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10593				0	lt	Empty line after each item				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"1495385090\"\>Adds an empty row after the data for each item in the pivot table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059A				0	lt	Show automatically				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090106.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059E				0	lt	Displays the top or bottom nn items when you sort by a specified field.				20130618 17:22:18
