helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\format_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_idN10558				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens a submenu to edit the properties of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\format_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id1650440				0	lt	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05990000.xhp\"\>Define Text Attributes\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\format_graphic.xhp	0	help	par_id363475				0	lt	Sets the layout and anchoring properties for text in the selected drawing or text object.				20130618 17:22:18
