helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver.xhp	0	help	par_id9210486				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Solver dialog. A solver allows to solve equations with multiple unknown variables by goal seeking methods.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
