helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205	93			0	lt	Moves the cursor to the first cell of the current row.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149897	94			0	lt	End				20130618 17:22:18
