helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143220	101			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Left Arrow				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766	102			0	lt	Moves the cursor to the left edge of the current data range. If the column to the left of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves to the next column to the left that contains data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153554	103			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Right Arrow				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155593	104			0	lt	Moves the cursor to the right edge of the current data range. If the column to the right of the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves to the next column to the right that contains data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149317	105			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Up Arrow				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153076	106			0	lt	Moves the cursor to the top edge of the current data range. If the row above the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves up to the next row that contains data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147250	107			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down Arrow				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149054	108			0	lt	Moves the cursor to the bottom edge of the current data range. If the row below the cell that contains the cursor is empty, the cursor moves down to the next row that contains data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148744	184			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Arrow				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159258	185			0	lt	Selects all cells containing data from the current cell to the end of the continuous range of data cells, in the direction of the arrow pressed. If used to select rows and columns together, a rectangular cell range is selected.				20130618 17:22:18
