helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AFC				0	lt	Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B00				0	lt	Adds the previous sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the previous sheet. Makes the previous sheet the current sheet.				20130618 17:22:18
