helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000140.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027	14			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_HELP_SEARCH_CB_FULLWORDS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to carry out an exact search for the word you entered. Incomplete words will not be found.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
