helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	10			0	lt	According to your selections, the wizard creates a document template and saves it on your hard disk. A new document based on the template appears in the work area, with the filename "UntitledX" (X stands for an automatic number).				20130618 17:22:18
