helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	1			0	lt	You can group records in a report based on the values in one or more fields. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the fields by which the resulting report will be grouped. You can group up to four fields in a report.\</ahelp\> When you group more than one field, $[officename] nests the groups according to their group level.				20130618 17:22:18
