helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110400.xhp	0	help	par_id3109850	2			0	lt	Specifies the information to be displayed on the title page of the publication.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149549	19			0	lt	You can skip this page if you unmark the \<emph\>Create title page\</emph\> option, or if you select Automatic or WebCast, in previous pages of the Wizard.				20130618 17:22:18
