helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100	2			0	lt	Defines a button style for navigation through the presentation slides.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155351	9			0	lt	This page is not visible if you have unmarked the \<emph\>Create title page\</emph\> check box, or if you have selected either automatic or WebCast export.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145090	7			0	lt	Select button style				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110500.xhp	0	help	par_id3155805	8			0	lt	Specifies whether you want to insert navigation buttons in your presentation. You can also select the style of the buttons.				20130618 17:22:18
