helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934	2			0	lt	Defines the colors for the publication.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	28			0	lt	Text formatting is obtained from the drawing or presentation. This page is skipped if you unmark the \<emph\>Create title page\</emph\> check box or if you select automatic or WebCast export.				20130618 17:22:18
