helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285	5			0	lt	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20130618 17:22:18
