helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943	10			0	lt	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				20130618 17:22:18
