helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ctl.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153662				0	lt	\<bookmark_value\>CTL;complex text layout languages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>languages;complex text layout\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text;CTL languages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text layout for special languages\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>right-to-left text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>entering text from right to left\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bi-directional writing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Hindi;entering text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Hebrew;entering text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Arabic;entering text\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Thai;entering text\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
