helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460	96			0	lt	Click the \<emph\>Run\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3152886\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sbanativesql.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152886\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. The result of the query is displayed in the upper window.				20130618 17:22:18
