helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3147008	3			0	lt	There are many options for moving or copying objects using drag-and-drop. Text sections, drawing objects, graphics, form controls, hyperlinks, cell ranges, and many more can be moved or copied with the mouse.				20130618 17:22:18
