helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	hd_id2454298				0	lt	\<variable id=\"groups\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/groups.xhp\"\>Working with Groups\</link\> \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id2307199				0	lt	You can combine several graphic objects into a group so that you can use them like a single object. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id9983825				0	lt	You can move, transform, resize, distort, or convert all objects in a group together, and you can enter the group any time to change the individual objects. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id5734733				0	lt	You can change the properties (line size, fill color, and more) of all objects in a group together, and you can enter the group and change the individual objects. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id561540				0	lt	Groups can also be nested to form groups within other groups. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	hd_id7705618				0	lt	To group objects				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id607013				0	lt	Select the objects together that you want to group. Hold down Shift while you click the individual objects.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id1399578				0	lt	Right-click any of the selected objects to open the context menu. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id598162				0	lt	In Impress or Draw, choose Group. In Calc or Writer, choose Group – Group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id6738792				0	lt	To select the objects, you can also drag a selection frame around the objects.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id7309793				0	lt	For example, you can group all of the objects in a company logo to move and resize the logo as a single object.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id1227759				0	lt	After you have grouped objects, selecting any part of the group selects the entire group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	hd_id7424237				0	lt	To enter a group				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id1388592				0	lt	Right-click any object of the group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id343943				0	lt	In Impress or Draw, choose Enter Group. In Calc or Writer, choose Group - Edit Group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id8726767				0	lt	Now you can select and edit a single object in the group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id691549				0	lt	You can add or delete objects to and from a group in this mode. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id9909665				0	lt	The objects that are not part of the group are shown with dimmed colors.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	hd_id9141819				0	lt	To exit a group				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id6354869				0	lt	Right-click any object of the group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id2685323				0	lt	In Impress or Draw, choose Exit Group. In Calc or Writer, choose Group - Exit Group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	par_id6042664				0	lt	To exit a group in Draw or Impress, you can also double-click anywhere outside the group.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\groups.xhp	0	help	hd_id7889950				0	lt	To ungroup a group				20130618 17:22:18
