helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	17			0	lt	The \<emph\>Hyperlink\</emph\> Bar can be used to search for the selected text in the Internet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10620				0	lt	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\> to open the Hyperlink Bar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267	18			0	lt	Enter the text you want to find in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> field.				20130618 17:22:18
