helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662	19			0	lt	Click the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> icon to open a submenu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3148538	20			0	lt	Select your preferred search engine from the list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271	21			0	lt	$[officename] opens your Web Browser, which calls the selected Internet search engine. After a short time you see the result of your search on screen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_search.xhp	0	help	par_idN10657				0	lt	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Search function in the Hyperlink Bar\"\>Internet - Search\</link\>\</emph\> to define the search options.				20130618 17:22:18
