helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	hd_id3093440	1			0	lt	\<variable id=\"macro_recording\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/macro_recording.xhp\" name=\"Recording a Macro\"\>Recording a Macro\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749	4			0	lt	Open the document for which you want to record a macro.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398	5			0	lt	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Macros - Record Macro\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275	6			0	lt	You see the small \<emph\>Recording\</emph\> dialog with just one button called \<emph\>Stop Recording\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087	7			0	lt	Perform the actions you want to be recorded in the document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	15			0	lt	Press the Escape key to deselect an object, as the macro recorder currently does not record this action by mouse click.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148492	8			0	lt	Click \<emph\>Stop Recording\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686	9			0	lt	The \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> dialog appears, in which you can save and run the macro.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158	10			0	lt	If you want to abort the recording without saving a macro, click the \<emph\>Close\</emph\> button of the \<emph\>Recording\</emph\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510	11			0	lt	To save the macro, first select the object where you want the macro to be saved in the \<emph\>Save macro in\</emph\> list box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550	12			0	lt	If you want the macro to be saved into a new library or module, click the \<emph\>New Library \</emph\>or \<emph\>New Module \</emph\>button and enter a name for the library or module.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456	13			0	lt	Enter a name for the new macro in the \<emph\>Macro name\</emph\> text box. Do not use Basic keywords as a name.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138	14			0	lt	Click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	hd_id2486342				0	lt	Limitations of the macro recorder				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id3608508				0	lt	The following actions are \<emph\>not\</emph\> recorded:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id921353				0	lt	Opening of windows is not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id9296243				0	lt	Actions carried out in another window than where the recorder was started are not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id4269234				0	lt	Window switching is not recorded.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id8014465				0	lt	Actions that are not related to the document contents are not recorded. For example, changes made in the Options dialog, macro organizer, customizing.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2814416				0	lt	Selections are recorded only if they are done by using the keyboard (cursor traveling), but not when the mouse is used.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\macro_recording.xhp	0	help	par_id2522354				0	lt	The macro recorder works only in Calc and Writer.				20130618 17:22:18
