helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200801491973				0	lt	In Calc, the formula =A1+A2 returns the value 2, and the formula =SUM(A1;A2) returns 2. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200801491972				0	lt	In Excel, the formula =A1+A2 returns 2, but the formula =SUM(A1,A2) returns 0.				20130618 17:22:18
