helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_user.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801	1			0	lt	$[officename] can open and save documents in the Microsoft Office file formats. Microsoft Office Open XML formats can be read, but not saved.				20130618 17:22:18
