helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983	73			0	lt	-help / -h / -?				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147349	74			0	lt	Lists the available command line parameters \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>in a dialog box\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>to the console\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20130618 17:22:18
