helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075	70			0	lt	Starts with an empty Writer master document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	71			0	lt	-web				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3148836	72			0	lt	Starts with an empty HTML document.				20130618 17:22:18
