helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A5A				0	lt	You can perform basic tests on a custom XML filter in %PRODUCTNAME.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A91				0	lt	The document is not altered by these tests. 				20130618 17:22:18
