helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682	2			0	lt	Use a \<emph\>Master Document\</emph\> to organize complex projects, such as a book. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>A \<emph\>Master Document\</emph\> can contain the individual files for each chapter of a book, as well as a table of contents, and an index.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
