helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555	9			0	lt	To change your return address, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010100.xhp\" name=\"%PRODUCTNAME\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</link\>\</emph\>, and then click on the \<emph\>User Data\</emph\> tab.				20130618 17:22:18
