helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285019				0	lt	The tab page with the same name as the current application can be used to define the contents, color, size, and pages to be printed. You define settings that are specific to the current document type.				20130618 17:22:18
