helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150506	41			0	lt	The supplied bibliography database contains sample records of books.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356	4			0	lt	Use the toolbar to select a table in the bibliography database, to search for records, or to sort the records using filters.				20130618 17:22:18
