helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155311	16			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To display all of the records in a table, click the \<emph\>Remove Filter\</emph\> icon.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
