helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154471	18			0	lt	To delete a record in the current table, right-click the row header of the record, and then select \<emph\>Delete\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETEROWS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected record.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
