helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153147	58			0	lt	If you apply underlining to a superscript text, the underlining is raised to the level of the superscript. If the superscript is contained in a word with normal text, the underlining is not raised.				20130618 17:22:18
