helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150756	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetAnchorToPage\"\>Anchors the selected item to the current page.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149987	4			0	lt	The anchored item remains on the current page even if you insert or delete text.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152821	3			0	lt	The anchor icon is displayed at the top left corner of the page.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	To Paragraph				20130618 17:22:18
