helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155271	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetAnchorToPara\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Anchors the selected item to the current paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154926	3			0	lt	The anchor icon is displayed at the left page margin at the beginning of the paragraph.				20130618 17:22:18
