helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05260400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150794	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SetAnchorToCell\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Anchors the selected item to a cell.\</ahelp\> The anchor icon is displayed in the upper left corner of the cell.				20130618 17:22:18
