helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290300.xhp	0	help	par_id3157991	3			0	lt	To select an individual object in a group,  hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\>, and then click the object.				20130618 17:22:18
