helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05350300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155583	7			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVXFLOAT_3D:LB_SHADEMODE\"\>Select the shading method that you want to use. Flat shading assigns a single color to a single polygon on the surface of the object. Gouraud shading blends colors across the polygons. Phong shading averages the color of each pixel based on the pixels that surround it, and requires the most processing power.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
