helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150467	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"texttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextAttributes\"\>Sets the layout and anchoring properties for text in the selected drawing or text object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150620	3			0	lt	This command is only available for drawing objects that can contain text, for example for rectangles, but not for lines.				20130618 17:22:18
