helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152375	60			0	lt	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Replace Custom Styles\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20130618 17:22:18
