helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155829	11			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"OFFMGR:CHECKBOX:RID_OFAPAGE_AUTOCORR_EXCEPT:CB_AUTOCAPS\"\>Automatically adds abbreviations or words that start with two capital letters to the corresponding list of exceptions. This feature only works if the \<emph\>Correct TWo INitial CApitals\</emph\> option or the Capitalize\<emph\> first letter of every sentence\</emph\> option are selected in the \<emph\>[T]\</emph\> column on\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"Options\"\>\<emph\>Options\</emph\>\</link\> tab of this dialog. \</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
