helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4129459				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to check for online updates of all installed extensions. To check for updates of the selected extension only, choose the Update command from the context menu. The check for availability of updates starts immediately.\</ahelp\> You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/extensionupdate.xhp\"\>Extension Update\</link\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
