helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id0103201110331832				0	lt	Some additional commands can appear in the context menu of an extension in the Extension Manager window, depending on the selected extension. You can choose to show the license text again. You can choose to exclude the extension from checking for updates or to include an excluded extension.				20130618 17:22:18
