helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148601	23			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Imagebutton\"\>Creates a button displayed as an image.\</ahelp\> Aside from the graphic representation, an image button has the same properties as a "normal" button.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159171	49			0	lt	Image Control				20130618 17:22:18
