helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596	50			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ImageControl\"\>Creates an image control. It can only be used to add images from a database.\</ahelp\> In the form document, double-click one of these controls to open the \<emph\>Insert Graphic\</emph\> dialog to insert the image. There is also a context menu (not in design mode) with commands for inserting and deleting the image.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150318	70			0	lt	Images from a database can be displayed in a form, and new images can be inserted in the database as long as the image control is not write-protected. The control must refer to a database field of the image type. Therefore, enter the data field into the properties window on the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156040	29			0	lt	Date Field				20130618 17:22:18
