helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151312	30			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DateField\"\>Creates a date field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the date values can be adopted from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151302	131			0	lt	If you assign the "Dropdown" property to the date field, the user can open a calendar to select a date under the date field. This also applies to a date field within a Table Control field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395	63			0	lt	Date fields can be easily edited by the user with the up arrow and down arrow keys. Depending on the cursor position, the day, month, or the year is can be increased or decreased using the arrow keys.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153112	132			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170003.xhp\" name=\"Specific Remarks on Date Fields\"\>Specific Remarks on Date Fields\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
