helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122	38			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947	67			0	lt	Please note that pattern fields are not exported into HTML format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145147	14			0	lt	Group Box				20130618 17:22:18
