helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154579	40			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a table control to display a database table.\</ahelp\> If you create a new table control, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\> appears.				20130618 17:22:18
