helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148566	143			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_WIDTH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the column width in the table control field.\</ahelp\>Sets the column width in the table control field in the units that are specified in the %PRODUCTNAME module options. If you want, you can enter a value followed by a valid measurement unit, for example, 2 cm.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id1877803				0	lt	Repeat				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id9863277				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_REPEAT\"\>Specifies if the action of a control such as a spin button repeats when you click the control and hold the mouse button down.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id9827875				0	lt	Delay				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id6092715				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_REPEAT_DELAY\"\>Specifies the delay in milliseconds between repeating events.\</ahelp\> A repeating event occurs when you click an arrow button or the background of a scrollbar, or one of the record navigation buttons of a Navigation Bar, and you keep the mouse button pressed for some time. You can enter a value followed by a valid time unit, for example, 2 s or 500 ms.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145164	214			0	lt	Record marker				20130618 17:22:18
