helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN111E8				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SCROLLVALUE_MIN\"\>Specify the minimum value of a scrollbar control.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
