helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B55				0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specify the value to add or subtract when the user clicks the arrow icon on the scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B6F				0	lt	Large change				20130618 17:22:18
