helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148983	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoFilter\"\>Filters the records, based on the content of the currently selected data field.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	lt	\<image id=\"img_id3147261\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfiltered.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147261\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147043	3			0	lt	AutoFilter				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155355	4			0	lt	Place the cursor in a field name whose content you want to filter and then click the \<emph\>AutoFilter\</emph\> icon. Only those records with content identical to the selected field name are visible.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159234	5			0	lt	For example, to view all the customers from New York, click a field name with the entry "New York". AutoFilter then filters all customers from New York from the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577	6			0	lt	You can remove the current AutoFilter with the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12040000.xhp\" name=\"Remove Filter/Sorting\"\>Remove Filter/Sorting\</link\> icon or with \<emph\>Data - Filter - Remove Filter\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	7			0	lt	To filter with several field names simultaneously, click the \<emph\>Default Filter \</emph\>icon. The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12090000.xhp\" name=\"Default Filter dialog\"\>Default Filter\</link\> dialog appears, in which you can combine several filter criteria.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12040000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Remove Filter/Sorting				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155069	1			0	lt	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/12040000.xhp\" name=\"Remove Filter/Sorting\"\>Remove Filter/Sorting\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154094	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RemoveFilterSort\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Cancels the filter settings and displays all of the records in the current table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146130				0	lt	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_removefilter.png\" id=\"img_id3151315\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151315\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
