helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149182	7			0	lt	Field name				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398	8			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_LISTBOX_DLG_FILTERCRIT_LB_WHEREFIELD3\"\>Specifies the field names from the current table to set them in the argument.\</ahelp\> You will see the column identifiers if no text is available for the field names.				20130618 17:22:18
