helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150254	10			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_LISTBOX_DLG_FILTERCRIT_LB_WHERECOMP3\"\>Specifies the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12090101.xhp\" name=\"comparative operators\"\>comparative operators\</link\> through which the entries in the \<emph\>Field name\</emph\> and \<emph\>Value\</emph\> fields can be linked.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
