helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150861	101			0	lt	State				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477	102			0	lt	The \<emph\>State\</emph\> line shows the records returned by the search. If the search reaches the end (or the beginning) of a table, the search is automatically continued at the other end.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163720	103			0	lt	In very large databases, finding the record in reverse search order can take some time. In this case, the status bar informs you that the records are still being counted.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147389	51			0	lt	Search / Cancel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154368	52			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_BTN_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Starts or cancels the search.\</ahelp\> If the search is successfully completed, the corresponding field in the table is highlighted. You can continue the search by clicking the \<emph\>Search\</emph\> button again. You can cancel a search process by clicking the \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> button.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145080	53			0	lt	Close				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156166	54			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_BTN_CLOSE\"\>Closes the dialog. The settings of the last search will be saved until you quit \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151183	104			0	lt	If several tables or forms are open, you can set different search options for each document. When you close the documents only the search options of the document last closed are saved.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	lt	Form-based Filters				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147000	1			0	lt	\<variable id=\"formfilter\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"Form-based Filters\"\>Form-based Filters\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230	2			0	lt	\<variable id=\"formfiltertext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFilter\"\>Prompts the database server to filter the visible data by specified criteria.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152918	3			0	lt	Unlike the normal search, which is activated by the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100200.xhp\" name=\"Find Record\"\>Find Record\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Form\</emph\> Bar, you can search more quickly by using the form-based filter. Usually a quick database server is charged with the search. Also, you can enter more complex search conditions.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	lt	\<image id=\"img_id3147226\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfilter.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147226\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
