helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFiltered\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Switches between the filtered and unfiltered view of the table.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999				0	lt	\<image src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formfiltered.png\" id=\"img_id3146130\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146130\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090	3			0	lt	Apply Filter				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147226	4			0	lt	The\<emph\> Apply Filter \</emph\>function retains \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12110000.xhp\" name=\"form-based filters\"\>form-based filters\</link\> that have been set. You do not need to redefine them.				20130618 17:22:18
