helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ViewFormAsGrid\"\>Activates an additional table view when in the form view.\</ahelp\> When the\<emph\> Data source as table\</emph\> function is activated, you see the table in an area above the form.				20130618 17:22:18
