helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149388	6			0	lt	INSRT				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147243	7			0	lt	In the insert mode, new text is inserted at the cursor position and the following text is shifted to the right. The cursor is displayed as a vertical line.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539	8			0	lt	OVER				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\20040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156327	9			0	lt	In the overwrite mode, any existing text is replaced by new text. The cursor is displayed as a thick vertical line.				20130618 17:22:18
