helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192	37			0	lt	To change the location of the backup copy, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</emph\>, and then enter a new path for the backup file.				20130618 17:22:18
