helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345	50			0	lt	Specifies that special regions, such as drawing text, are checked during spellcheck.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166429	21			0	lt	Check spelling as you type				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	6			0	lt	\<variable id=\"automatisch\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpellOnline\"\>Automatically checks spelling as you type, and underlines errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156291	32			0	lt	Typing errors are highlighted in the document with a red underline. If you place the cursor over a word marked in this way, you can open the context menu to obtain a list of corrections. Select a correction to replace the word. If you make the same mistake again while editing the document, it will be marked as an error again.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153815	23			0	lt	To place the word pair in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect replacement table\"\>AutoCorrect replacement table\</link\>, open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040500.xhp\" name=\"AutoCorrect context menu\"\>AutoCorrect context menu\</link\> and choose \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\>. Make your selection from the submenu. The word is replaced and at the same time the word pair is placed in the replacement table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150111	53			0	lt	Minimal number of characters for hyphenation 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150316	54			0	lt	Specifies the minimum number of characters required for automatic hyphenation to be applied. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_LNGDLG_NUM_PREBREAK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\> Type the minimum number of characters that must come before or after the hyphen.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148823	11			0	lt	Characters before line break				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156029	12			0	lt	Sets the minimum number of characters of the word to be hyphenated that must remain at the end of the line.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154956	13			0	lt	Characters after line break				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149439	14			0	lt	Specifies the minimum number of characters of a hyphenated word required at the next line.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156337	15			0	lt	Hyphenate without inquiry				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151130	16			0	lt	Specifies that you will never be asked for a manual hyphenation. If the field is not marked, when a word is not recognized you will be presented with a dialog for entering hyphens.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155900	17			0	lt	Hyphenate special regions				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098	18			0	lt	Specifies that hyphenation will also be carried out in footnotes, headers and footers.				20130618 17:22:18
