helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778813				0	lt	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the CMYK color model. CMYK refers to the four inks used in some color printing: cyan, magenta, yellow, and key (black).				20130618 17:22:18
