helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685	11			0	lt	Accesses the Internet without a proxy server. Allows you to set up a connection directly on your computer to an Internet provider that does not use a proxy.				20130618 17:22:18
