helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155	15			0	lt	Lets you enter the proxy server manually. Specify the proxy servers in accordance with your Internet service. Ask your system administrator for the proxies and ports to enter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943	29			0	lt	Type server names without the protocol prefix. For example, type www.example.com, not http://www.example.com.				20130618 17:22:18
