helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193	22			0	lt	Suffix				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970	23			0	lt	The search terms are passed between the prefix and the suffix.\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_POSTFIX\"\>The suffix provides the command sequence, sent at the end of a search.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
