helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872	29			0	lt	You must activate this option before you create the $[officename] Basic Script, since otherwise it will not be inserted. $[officename] Basic Scripts must be located in the header of the HTML document. Once you have created the macro in the $[officename] Basic IDE, it appears in the source text of the HTML document in the header.				20130618 17:22:18
