helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944	38			0	lt	You can also control the display of graphics through the \<link href=\"text/swriter/02/18120000.xhp\" name=\"Graphics\"\>\<emph\>Graphics On/Off\</emph\>\</link\> icon. If a text document is open, this icon is displayed on the \<emph\>Tools\</emph\> bar.				20130618 17:22:18
