helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060700.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892	3			0	lt	\<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Print\</emph\> defines the settings for all spreadsheets. To define settings for the current document only, choose \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>, then click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> button.				20130618 17:22:18
