helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154744	67			0	lt	... The field name is empty. For Yes/No fields with three states, this command automatically queries the undetermined state (neither Yes nor No).				20130618 17:22:18
