helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	lt	The context menu of the table container offers various functions that apply to all database tables. To edit a special table within the database, select the corresponding table and open its context menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3146958	4			0	lt	Depending on the context, it is possible that not all the functions for your current database are listed in the context menus. For example, the \<emph\>Relationships\</emph\> command for defining relationships between various tables is only available with relational databases.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382	3			0	lt	Depending on the database system used, you will find the following entries on the context menus:				20130618 17:22:18
