helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145607	15			0	lt	Drives containing parts of the Serverdb are called DEVSPACEs. To improve performance, store each DEVSPACE on separate drives.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985	36			0	lt	The file path for a DEVSPACE, including its file name, cannot exceed 40 characters.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146148	16			0	lt	SYSDEVSPACE				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064	17			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSDEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the system DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> The SYSDEVSPACE manages the configuration data for the database. The size of the SYSDEVSPACE depends on the size of the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147319	18			0	lt	TRANSACTIONLOG				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190	19			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_TRANSACTIONLOG\"\>Enter the path for the transaction log file.\</ahelp\> This file records all modifications that are made to the database during a transaction, and overwrites them when the transaction is completed. The TRANSACTIONLOG is also used for the rollback of a transaction.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748	20			0	lt	DATADEVSPACE				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597	21			0	lt	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the data DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> This file stores user data, such as tables and indexes, as well as the SQL catalog (schema info). The data contained in one user table is evenly distributed across all DATADEVSPACEs. The combined size of all DATADEVSPACEs corresponds to the size of the database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103	22			0	lt	The maximum size for a DATADEVSPACE in the limited version Adabas database is 100MB.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426	23			0	lt	If the DATADEVSPACE reaches full capacity during a database operation, Adabas shuts down, increases the capacity of the DATADEVSPACE (up to 100 MB), and restarts the database. Saved data is not lost.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153189	24			0	lt	...				20130618 17:22:18
