helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id1068758				0	lt	Press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift-F1\</item\> and point with the mouse at an input box to see a help text for this input box.				20130618 17:22:18
